# Un'Goro Crater - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns and plans whose SOURCE is physically in Un'Goro
# (zone key 1449), verified against the local Forever game data
# (questie-forever item drop/vendor tables). Three are vendor-sold by the
# crater's two both-faction vendors; seven drop from in-zone mobs (six sole
# sources, one four-source all-in-zone ooze family). Every shipped step is
# gated to its profession; other characters skip it cleanly. Alchemy,
# Blacksmithing, Tailoring, Enchanting, Engineering, First Aid and Fishing
# have no Un'Goro source - stated here, not padded. Quest records carry no
# reward data, so no quest-reward recipe ships (see
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught staples are excluded. Stock
# class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the data; no line is marked
# limited.
guide butler-routes-completionist/ungoro-recipes
title Un'Goro Crater - Recipes & Patterns
levels 47-54
zone Un'Goro Crater
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords ungoro, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step South-west crater - scorpid patterns (buy)

  zone map 1449

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  vendor 12956 -- Zannok Hidepiercer (23.0,16.4)
  buy 15724 "Pattern: Heavy Scorpid Bracers"
  buy 15762 "Pattern: Heavy Scorpid Helm"
  note Zannok Hidepiercer (both-faction) sells both patterns at the south-west camp; nothing else in the data sells them. Stock class unconfirmed.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Marshal's Refuge - devilsaur gauntlets (buy)

  zone map 1449

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  vendor 12959 -- Nergal (43.27,7.73)
  buy 15758 "Pattern: Devilsaur Gauntlets"
  note Nergal (both-faction) sells the pattern at Marshal's Refuge; nothing else in the data sells it. Stock class unconfirmed.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Ooze pits - devilsaur leggings (Leatherworking)

  zone map 1449

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  loop
  goto 57.19,38.36
  goto 60.92,37.6
  goto 38.52,17.34
  goto 43.47,65.21
  goto 25.62,45.47
  goto 28.21,35.87
  goto 45.44,66.04
  goto 56.2,18.13
  kill 6556 optional
  kill 6557 optional
  kill 6559 optional
  kill 9477 optional
  collect 15772 "Pattern: Devilsaur Leggings" optional
  note The four Un'Goro oozes (Muculent, Primal, Glutinous, Cloned) are the only droppers anywhere in the data and spawn only here. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step North-west crater - devilcore patterns (Leatherworking)

  zone map 1449

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  goto 35.3,35.99
  kill 6584 optional
  collect 228119 "Pattern: Devilcore Gauntlets" optional
  collect 228120 "Pattern: Devilcore Leggings" optional
  note King Mosh (level 60 devilsaur, rank-2 elite) is the sole dropper anywhere in the data - come back after the core route (skull-level to a fresh 54). No quest takes either pattern. (Mosh stays out of the rares companion per the rank rule; this recipes hunt is his coverage.)
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

